:\n- Activates my only major piece\n- Puts immediate pressure on Black's King\n- Controls the open d-file\n- Could create tactical threats\n\n**Reason:** \nWith significant material down, I need to maximize piece activity and create immediate threats. Placing my Rook on d1 attacks the Black King directly on d8, forces Black to respond, and gives me the best practical chances. Passive moves will simply allow Black to consolidate and convert the material advantage systematically.\n\n**Answer:** R: h1-d1"}
